    "spec": "Replace the level rules with a points system: start at 0; add 2 when an email is present; add 1 when namesakeCount is 0; add 2 for a household of 3 or more; add 3 for tenure over 365 days. Map 'membershipPoints' to 'membershipLevel' as 1 (0-1 points), 2 (2-3), 3 (4-5), 4 (6 or more). Return both fields. This changes the existing rule that computed the membership level directly from those factors.",
